  "duration_s": 397.108005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国最适合慢慢走的原生态古镇是哪一个吗？有人说是乌镇。有人说是西塘错了，那些地方走几步就碰肩膀，真正的榜首不在江南水乡，也不在旅游大干线上。它藏在一片宁静山谷里，一条清澈江水流过老石桥。一座六百年的古戏台立在空地上，连骡马走过的堤印还在。今天咱们就来盘点中国十大最适合慢慢走的原生态古镇。看到这儿觉得有点意思的朋友，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，收藏起来，省得手一滑，咱们就错过了第十名。目睹古镇江苏苏州，他在苏州城西边灵岩山脚下，一条河川镇过园子，和人家都挨着水。老外人说，两千五百年前，吴王夫差给西施修宫殿，全国的木头运过来，堵满了河道，证明就这么来的。后来乾隆六次下江南，据说回回的往这儿跑，可您今天去，不用直奔园子，顺着河边的老街走青石板路，平平整整，不爬坡，累了就在廊桥边找张茶桌坐下。红印山房里常能赶上平淡，软软的无语，听不懂也不要紧。一杯茶的功夫，脚底下赶路的那股劲儿就谢了头。一战，先让您的脚慢下来。第九名，新市古镇，浙江湖州德清，他挨着运河，是个没怎么被包装过的水乡老镇镇上有几十座老石桥，一座接一座把河两岸连在一块儿，老辈子这儿靠养蚕麦斯过日子，镇子是被蚕丝养大的。您今天去找不着满街吆喝的铺子，青藻合不投，蹲着洗菜的老街坊，手里洗着嘴上聊着家长里短，河边茶滩的水壶一直冒热气。您端一杯坐下，没人催，您买东西也没人催，您赶下一站，别的阵子是摆出来给您看的心事，是人家自己在过日子。您走进去就像串门，不吵人，也不用拘着。第八名。青木川古镇陕西汉中宁强，他卧在陕西、甘肃、四川三省交界的秦巴山地里回龙场老街足足有八百多米长，远远看过去像一条青龙趴在金旗河畔，沿街保留着五十多座完整的四合院和汉船房。这里以前是陕南茶马贸易的要道，岁月把老街磨得油光发亮，星辰的商雾从河面上漫上来，木隔窗棂后面飘出早点的热气，既有西北秦岭的厚重，又有巴蜀水汽的润泽。没有喧闹的喇叭，走在石板路上能听见自己的脚步声，大山深处的踏实与自得，全在这一条老街里。第七名乾同古镇，浙江宁波、宁海这座古镇被群山环抱，里面完好保存着上千间。明清传统老屋乾通最绝的是八卦水系，引来白皙的活水，家家户户门前都躺着清泉路面全是用溪水里的鹅卵石，一块块铺平的踩上去圆润贴脚。这里宗族传了七百多年，家家户户讲究耕读传家，房门常年敞着，老人们坐在堂屋前，晒太阳编竹筐，推开门就是流水，推几步就是潺潺，全生人和山水挨着。过了七百年，您去走一趟步子，自己就慢下来了第六名。偏远古镇重庆北碚讲到这里，上级的分量就开始变重了。很多人以为巴蜀古镇都在深山，悬崖上可偏沿，偏偏依着黑水滩河顺着河道铺开一条老街，地势平展的很一点不费脚力，镇上立的好几十足，几百年的老黄爵树。树冠大的像把巨伞遮天蔽日，几百张竹椅，就顺着河滩一字排开，一壶清茶，只要几块钱，河水清的能见底，在树荫下哗啦啦流淌。重庆夏天的太阳再险，坐在这儿也凉风习习，您走累了，要一盅茶坐下，满耳朵都是水生巴蜀的山，再咸这的日子是平的。从第十到第六名，牧渎在廊桥边听平淡，心是在河埠头，洗菜过日子，青木川，在三省交界处藏着老街。钱童饮清泉流过，每家门前偏言在百岁老树下摆开竹椅。可他们还不是最适合慢慢走的。接下来第五道第一名更让人心动，有一座水乡，把三十六六座古石桥架在开阔大湖之上，走一步看一处景，还有一座古镇，把明清老屋全浸在天青色的烟雨里，白墙黑瓦连着青山，可排在榜首的那座，既不在江南，也不在巴蜀。他被大山紧紧护在怀里，把数百年前茶马古道的古籍是原原本本活到了今天。他是哪座？他凭什么排在周庄乌镇前面下一集已经同步更新，点开我的头像，进入主页就能看到点个关注，看看谁才是中国最适合慢慢走的古镇。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00001",
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 5310,
      "text": "您知道中国最适合慢慢走的原生态古镇是哪一个吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5850,
      "end_ms": 6990,
      "text": "有人说是乌镇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7570,
      "end_ms": 9790,
      "text": "有人说是西塘错了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10210,
      "end_ms": 12490,
      "text": "那些地方走几步就碰肩膀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13230,
      "end_ms": 15590,
      "text": "真正的榜首不在江南水乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00006",
      "start_ms": 16190,
      "end_ms": 17930,
      "text": "也不在旅游大干线上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18370,
      "end_ms": 20630,
      "text": "它藏在一片宁静山谷里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00008",
      "start_ms": 21050,
      "end_ms": 23730,
      "text": "一条清澈江水流过老石桥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00009",
      "start_ms": 24210,
      "end_ms": 27210,
      "text": "一座六百年的古戏台立在空地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00010",
      "start_ms": 27670,
      "end_ms": 30480,
      "text": "连骡马走过的堤印还在。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00011",
      "start_ms": 30960,
      "end_ms": 36980,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国十大最适合慢慢走的原生态古镇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00012",
      "start_ms": 37340,
      "end_ms": 39700,
      "text": "看到这儿觉得有点意思的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00013",
      "start_ms": 40260,
      "end_ms": 42620,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00014",
      "start_ms": 42740,
      "end_ms": 43640,
      "text": "收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00015",
      "start_ms": 44120,
      "end_ms": 45200,
      "text": "省得手一滑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00016",
      "start_ms": 45280,
      "end_ms": 47340,
      "text": "咱们就错过了第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47700,
      "end_ms": 49920,
      "text": "目睹古镇江苏苏州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00018",
      "start_ms": 50640,
      "end_ms": 54040,
      "text": "他在苏州城西边灵岩山脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54520,
      "end_ms": 57160,
      "text": "一条河川镇过园子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00020",
      "start_ms": 57160,
      "end_ms": 58540,
      "text": "和人家都挨着水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00021",
      "start_ms": 58920,
      "end_ms": 59765,
      "text": "老外人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00022",
      "start_ms": 60380,
      "end_ms": 61600,
      "text": "两千五百年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00023",
      "start_ms": 62020,
      "end_ms": 64135,
      "text": "吴王夫差给西施修宫殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00024",
      "start_ms": 64490,
      "end_ms": 66050,
      "text": "全国的木头运过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00025",
      "start_ms": 66070,
      "end_ms": 67015,
      "text": "堵满了河道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00026",
      "start_ms": 67650,
      "end_ms": 68865,
      "text": "证明就这么来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00027",
      "start_ms": 69380,
      "end_ms": 71615,
      "text": "后来乾隆六次下江南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00028",
      "start_ms": 72050,
      "end_ms": 73575,
      "text": "据说回回的往这儿跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00029",
      "start_ms": 74050,
      "end_ms": 75415,
      "text": "可您今天去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00030",
      "start_ms": 75750,
      "end_ms": 77105,
      "text": "不用直奔园子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00031",
      "start_ms": 77470,
      "end_ms": 80540,
      "text": "顺着河边的老街走青石板路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00032",
      "start_ms": 80560,
      "end_ms": 81485,
      "text": "平平整整，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00033",
      "start_ms": 81740,
      "end_ms": 82455,
      "text": "不爬坡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00034",
      "start_ms": 82960,
      "end_ms": 85845,
      "text": "累了就在廊桥边找张茶桌坐下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00035",
      "start_ms": 86260,
      "end_ms": 88865,
      "text": "红印山房里常能赶上平淡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00036",
      "start_ms": 89370,
      "end_ms": 90450,
      "text": "软软的无语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00037",
      "start_ms": 90570,
      "end_ms": 91905,
      "text": "听不懂也不要紧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00038",
      "start_ms": 92650,
      "end_ms": 93810,
      "text": "一杯茶的功夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00039",
      "start_ms": 94210,
      "end_ms": 97750,
      "text": "脚底下赶路的那股劲儿就谢了头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00040",
      "start_ms": 97750,
      "end_ms": 98185,
      "text": "一战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00041",
      "start_ms": 98730,
      "end_ms": 100635,
      "text": "先让您的脚慢下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00042",
      "start_ms": 101030,
      "end_ms": 101905,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00043",
      "start_ms": 102510,
      "end_ms": 103515,
      "text": "新市古镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00044",
      "start_ms": 103950,
      "end_ms": 105275,
      "text": "浙江湖州德清，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00045",
      "start_ms": 106010,
      "end_ms": 107165,
      "text": "他挨着运河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00046",
      "start_ms": 107740,
      "end_ms": 114025,
      "text": "是个没怎么被包装过的水乡老镇镇上有几十座老石桥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00047",
      "start_ms": 114600,
      "end_ms": 117965,
      "text": "一座接一座把河两岸连在一块儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00048",
      "start_ms": 118400,
      "end_ms": 122145,
      "text": "老辈子这儿靠养蚕麦斯过日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00049",
      "start_ms": 122580,
      "end_ms": 124755,
      "text": "镇子是被蚕丝养大的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00050",
      "start_ms": 125280,
      "end_ms": 129075,
      "text": "您今天去找不着满街吆喝的铺子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00051",
      "start_ms": 129570,
      "end_ms": 130775,
      "text": "青藻合不投，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00052",
      "start_ms": 131150,
      "end_ms": 132895,
      "text": "蹲着洗菜的老街坊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00053",
      "start_ms": 133410,
      "end_ms": 136825,
      "text": "手里洗着嘴上聊着家长里短，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00054",
      "start_ms": 137320,
      "end_ms": 140625,
      "text": "河边茶滩的水壶一直冒热气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00055",
      "start_ms": 141350,
      "end_ms": 142755,
      "text": "您端一杯坐下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00056",
      "start_ms": 143280,
      "end_ms": 143980,
      "text": "没人催，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00057",
      "start_ms": 143980,
      "end_ms": 146470,
      "text": "您买东西也没人催，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00058",
      "start_ms": 146470,
      "end_ms": 147655,
      "text": "您赶下一站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00059",
      "start_ms": 148070,
      "end_ms": 151930,
      "text": "别的阵子是摆出来给您看的心事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00060",
      "start_ms": 151990,
      "end_ms": 154145,
      "text": "是人家自己在过日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00061",
      "start_ms": 154790,
      "end_ms": 157805,
      "text": "您走进去就像串门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00062",
      "start_ms": 158430,
      "end_ms": 159305,
      "text": "不吵人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00063",
      "start_ms": 159680,
      "end_ms": 161005,
      "text": "也不用拘着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00064",
      "start_ms": 161380,
      "end_ms": 161985,
      "text": "第八名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00065",
      "start_ms": 162510,
      "end_ms": 165775,
      "text": "青木川古镇陕西汉中宁强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00066",
      "start_ms": 166620,
      "end_ms": 175095,
      "text": "他卧在陕西、甘肃、四川三省交界的秦巴山地里回龙场老街足足有八百多米长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00067",
      "start_ms": 175700,
      "end_ms": 179175,
      "text": "远远看过去像一条青龙趴在金旗河畔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00068",
      "start_ms": 179740,
      "end_ms": 184095,
      "text": "沿街保留着五十多座完整的四合院和汉船房。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00069",
      "start_ms": 184530,
      "end_ms": 187455,
      "text": "这里以前是陕南茶马贸易的要道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00070",
      "start_ms": 188090,
      "end_ms": 190625,
      "text": "岁月把老街磨得油光发亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00071",
      "start_ms": 191040,
      "end_ms": 194095,
      "text": "星辰的商雾从河面上漫上来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00072",
      "start_ms": 194710,
      "end_ms": 197945,
      "text": "木隔窗棂后面飘出早点的热气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00073",
      "start_ms": 198650,
      "end_ms": 200795,
      "text": "既有西北秦岭的厚重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00074",
      "start_ms": 201230,
      "end_ms": 203415,
      "text": "又有巴蜀水汽的润泽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00075",
      "start_ms": 203800,
      "end_ms": 205185,
      "text": "没有喧闹的喇叭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00076",
      "start_ms": 205660,
      "end_ms": 208945,
      "text": "走在石板路上能听见自己的脚步声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00077",
      "start_ms": 209470,
      "end_ms": 211735,
      "text": "大山深处的踏实与自得，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00078",
      "start_ms": 212180,
      "end_ms": 213815,
      "text": "全在这一条老街里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00079",
      "start_ms": 214200,
      "end_ms": 216765,
      "text": "第七名乾同古镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00080",
      "start_ms": 217540,
      "end_ms": 221995,
      "text": "浙江宁波、宁海这座古镇被群山环抱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00081",
      "start_ms": 222630,
      "end_ms": 225170,
      "text": "里面完好保存着上千间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00082",
      "start_ms": 225290,
      "end_ms": 229285,
      "text": "明清传统老屋乾通最绝的是八卦水系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00083",
      "start_ms": 229650,
      "end_ms": 231045,
      "text": "引来白皙的活水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00084",
      "start_ms": 231570,
      "end_ms": 237895,
      "text": "家家户户门前都躺着清泉路面全是用溪水里的鹅卵石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00085",
      "start_ms": 238260,
      "end_ms": 242090,
      "text": "一块块铺平的踩上去圆润贴脚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00086",
      "start_ms": 242510,
      "end_ms": 244670,
      "text": "这里宗族传了七百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00087",
      "start_ms": 245350,
      "end_ms": 248149,
      "text": "家家户户讲究耕读传家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00088",
      "start_ms": 248810,
      "end_ms": 250650,
      "text": "房门常年敞着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00089",
      "start_ms": 251110,
      "end_ms": 252930,
      "text": "老人们坐在堂屋前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00090",
      "start_ms": 253050,
      "end_ms": 254490,
      "text": "晒太阳编竹筐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00091",
      "start_ms": 254930,
      "end_ms": 256330,
      "text": "推开门就是流水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00092",
      "start_ms": 256830,
      "end_ms": 258490,
      "text": "推几步就是潺潺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00093",
      "start_ms": 258610,
      "end_ms": 261250,
      "text": "全生人和山水挨着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00094",
      "start_ms": 261270,
      "end_ms": 262210,
      "text": "过了七百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00095",
      "start_ms": 262870,
      "end_ms": 264490,
      "text": "您去走一趟步子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00096",
      "start_ms": 264490,
      "end_ms": 266570,
      "text": "自己就慢下来了第六名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00097",
      "start_ms": 266970,
      "end_ms": 271250,
      "text": "偏远古镇重庆北碚讲到这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00098",
      "start_ms": 271850,
      "end_ms": 274310,
      "text": "上级的分量就开始变重了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00099",
      "start_ms": 274630,
      "end_ms": 277410,
      "text": "很多人以为巴蜀古镇都在深山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00100",
      "start_ms": 277450,
      "end_ms": 279450,
      "text": "悬崖上可偏沿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00101",
      "start_ms": 279630,
      "end_ms": 283990,
      "text": "偏偏依着黑水滩河顺着河道铺开一条老街，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00102",
      "start_ms": 284590,
      "end_ms": 287750,
      "text": "地势平展的很一点不费脚力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00103",
      "start_ms": 288170,
      "end_ms": 290030,
      "text": "镇上立的好几十足，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00104",
      "start_ms": 290030,
      "end_ms": 291705,
      "text": "几百年的老黄爵树。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00105",
      "start_ms": 292550,
      "end_ms": 296150,
      "text": "树冠大的像把巨伞遮天蔽日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00106",
      "start_ms": 296990,
      "end_ms": 298190,
      "text": "几百张竹椅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00107",
      "start_ms": 298370,
      "end_ms": 300690,
      "text": "就顺着河滩一字排开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00108",
      "start_ms": 301450,
      "end_ms": 302490,
      "text": "一壶清茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00109",
      "start_ms": 302590,
      "end_ms": 303570,
      "text": "只要几块钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00110",
      "start_ms": 303930,
      "end_ms": 305910,
      "text": "河水清的能见底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00111",
      "start_ms": 306530,
      "end_ms": 308950,
      "text": "在树荫下哗啦啦流淌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00112",
      "start_ms": 309650,
      "end_ms": 311890,
      "text": "重庆夏天的太阳再险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00113",
      "start_ms": 312470,
      "end_ms": 314470,
      "text": "坐在这儿也凉风习习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00114",
      "start_ms": 314830,
      "end_ms": 315710,
      "text": "您走累了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00115",
      "start_ms": 315950,
      "end_ms": 317270,
      "text": "要一盅茶坐下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00116",
      "start_ms": 317710,
      "end_ms": 320690,
      "text": "满耳朵都是水生巴蜀的山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00117",
      "start_ms": 320750,
      "end_ms": 323520,
      "text": "再咸这的日子是平的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00118",
      "start_ms": 323920,
      "end_ms": 325620,
      "text": "从第十到第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00119",
      "start_ms": 326180,
      "end_ms": 328560,
      "text": "牧渎在廊桥边听平淡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00120",
      "start_ms": 329160,
      "end_ms": 330600,
      "text": "心是在河埠头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00121",
      "start_ms": 330680,
      "end_ms": 331840,
      "text": "洗菜过日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00122",
      "start_ms": 332360,
      "end_ms": 333040,
      "text": "青木川，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00123",
      "start_ms": 333100,
      "end_ms": 335560,
      "text": "在三省交界处藏着老街。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00124",
      "start_ms": 336160,
      "end_ms": 338020,
      "text": "钱童饮清泉流过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00125",
      "start_ms": 338220,
      "end_ms": 342860,
      "text": "每家门前偏言在百岁老树下摆开竹椅。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00126",
      "start_ms": 343220,
      "end_ms": 345960,
      "text": "可他们还不是最适合慢慢走的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00127",
      "start_ms": 346480,
      "end_ms": 349260,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更让人心动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00128",
      "start_ms": 349920,
      "end_ms": 351060,
      "text": "有一座水乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00129",
      "start_ms": 351460,
      "end_ms": 355175,
      "text": "把三十六六座古石桥架在开阔大湖之上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00130",
      "start_ms": 355650,
      "end_ms": 357155,
      "text": "走一步看一处景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00131",
      "start_ms": 357860,
      "end_ms": 358985,
      "text": "还有一座古镇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00132",
      "start_ms": 359230,
      "end_ms": 362935,
      "text": "把明清老屋全浸在天青色的烟雨里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00133",
      "start_ms": 363490,
      "end_ms": 365795,
      "text": "白墙黑瓦连着青山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00134",
      "start_ms": 366180,
      "end_ms": 368245,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00135",
      "start_ms": 368840,
      "end_ms": 369940,
      "text": "既不在江南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00136",
      "start_ms": 370260,
      "end_ms": 371545,
      "text": "也不在巴蜀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00137",
      "start_ms": 372180,
      "end_ms": 374465,
      "text": "他被大山紧紧护在怀里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00138",
      "start_ms": 375000,
      "end_ms": 380305,
      "text": "把数百年前茶马古道的古籍是原原本本活到了今天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00139",
      "start_ms": 380700,
      "end_ms": 381415,
      "text": "他是哪座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00140",
      "start_ms": 381860,
      "end_ms": 387455,
      "text": "他凭什么排在周庄乌镇前面下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00141",
      "start_ms": 388210,
      "end_ms": 389410,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00142",
      "start_ms": 389570,
      "end_ms": 392905,
      "text": "进入主页就能看到点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_849c3889a3d48662_s00143",
      "start_ms": 393180,
      "end_ms": 396875,
      "text": "看看谁才是中国最适合慢慢走的古镇。"
    }
  ],
